    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The explosive sequel to the classic armored warfare experience returns, bigger, bolder, and more tactical than ever. Spearhead 2 puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of the most advanced military vehicles on Earth, delivering intense single-player and co-op combat across modern-day warzones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're leading a solo charge or coordinating with your squad, every mission will test your skill, your strategy, and your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/0a77a652fba4d44aa565a2f0fb80e3c3.poster.avif?t=1749890755\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/0a77a652fba4d44aa565a2f0fb80e3c3.webm?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/0a77a652fba4d44aa565a2f0fb80e3c3.mp4?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Modern Armored Combat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of meticulously detailed tanks, IFVs, and APCs\u2014each with fully modeled, functional interiors and realistic handling. From turret to treads, every switch matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic, Real-World Battlegrounds</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy across high-stakes combat zones\u2014from shattered urban sprawls in Eastern Europe to sun-scorched Middle Eastern deserts. Missions unfold in immersive, destructible environments with dynamic objectives that keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Co-Op Warfare</strong><br>Team up with up to 16 players in co-op multiplayer missions where communication and coordination are key. No lone wolves here\u2014only squads that survive together, or not at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Campaign Missions</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a wide range of scenario-driven objectives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Ambush hostile convoys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Defend strategic bases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Clear war-torn cities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Eliminate high-value targets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Vehicle Maintenance</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor only gets you so far. Keep your vehicle operational under fire with in-field maintenance, supported by your logistics network. Smart repairs can turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/bdf59372592a0aa3ea8889f7415904c2.poster.avif?t=1749890755\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/bdf59372592a0aa3ea8889f7415904c2.webm?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/bdf59372592a0aa3ea8889f7415904c2.mp4?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead the charge. Support the line. Break the enemy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Spearhead 2</strong></i> delivers a modern battlefield experience that blends realism, action, and teamwork like never before. Whether you're flanking enemy armor or holding position under pressure, every second behind the controls counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The explosive sequel to the classic armored warfare experience returns, bigger, bolder, and more tactical than ever. Spearhead 2 puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of the most advanced military vehicles on Earth, delivering intense single-player and co-op combat across modern-day warzones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're leading a solo charge or coordinating with your squad, every mission will test your skill, your strategy, and your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/0a77a652fba4d44aa565a2f0fb80e3c3.poster.avif?t=1749890755\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/0a77a652fba4d44aa565a2f0fb80e3c3.webm?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/0a77a652fba4d44aa565a2f0fb80e3c3.mp4?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Modern Armored Combat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of meticulously detailed tanks, IFVs, and APCs\u2014each with fully modeled, functional interiors and realistic handling. From turret to treads, every switch matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic, Real-World Battlegrounds</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy across high-stakes combat zones\u2014from shattered urban sprawls in Eastern Europe to sun-scorched Middle Eastern deserts. Missions unfold in immersive, destructible environments with dynamic objectives that keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Co-Op Warfare</strong><br>Team up with up to 16 players in co-op multiplayer missions where communication and coordination are key. No lone wolves here\u2014only squads that survive together, or not at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Campaign Missions</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a wide range of scenario-driven objectives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Ambush hostile convoys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Defend strategic bases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Clear war-torn cities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Eliminate high-value targets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Vehicle Maintenance</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor only gets you so far. Keep your vehicle operational under fire with in-field maintenance, supported by your logistics network. Smart repairs can turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/bdf59372592a0aa3ea8889f7415904c2.poster.avif?t=1749890755\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/bdf59372592a0aa3ea8889f7415904c2.webm?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750400/extras/bdf59372592a0aa3ea8889f7415904c2.mp4?t=1749890755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead the charge. Support the line. Break the enemy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Spearhead 2</strong></i> delivers a modern battlefield experience that blends realism, action, and teamwork like never before. Whether you're flanking enemy armor or holding position under pressure, every second behind the controls counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Spearhead 2 is a tank simulator that puts you in command of an M1A2 Abrams Main Battle Tank in tactical combat. Lead your team through intense missions, strategize effectively, and dominate the battlefield in this immersive mix of action and simulation gameplay.",
